1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:11,408
Politico reports that US ambassador Warren Stephens warned Britain could face tariffs if Prime Minister Andy Burnham raises taxes on major tech companies.

2
00:00:11,358 --> 00:00:17,770
The comments show how digital taxes are becoming a trade dispute, not only a budget issue.

3
00:00:17,770 --> 00:00:26,961
For Europe, the case matters because governments want more revenue from Big Tech while trying to avoid a new clash with Washington.

